erning isotonic beverages, focusing on their osmolality to ensure optimal hydration and energy replenishment for athletes. Additionally, the organization has drafted a comprehensive report on the composition of foods and beverages designed to meet the energy expenditure needs of individuals engaged in intense muscular efforts, emphasizing the importance of proper nutrition in athletic training and performance.", "FEDERACIÓN ESPAÑOLA DE MEDICINA DEL DEPORTE:The Federación Española de Medicina del Deporte is a group that published a consensus document on nutrition in 2008, endorsing specific beverage compositions for athletes.", "ERGOGENIA:Ergogenia refers to methods and techniques aimed at enhancing physical and mental performance in sports.", "TAURINA:TAURINA, also known as taurine, is a sulfur-containing amino acid that plays a crucial role in various physiological functions. It is often discussed in nutritional contexts due to its potential benefits. In the realm of infant nutrition, TAURINA may be added to infant formulas to support immune function and promote gastrointestinal development. Additionally, taurine is recognized for its use among athletes, as it may enhance physical performance. Overall, TAURINA is significant for both developmental and performance-related applications.", "GINSENG:Ginseng is an herbal supplement that may be used by athletes to enhance performance.", "INOSINA:Inosine is a supplement that may be used by athletes to improve performance.", "TÉ VERDE:Green tea is a beverage that may be consumed by athletes for its potential performance-enhancing properties.", "AGENTES ALCALINIZANTES:Alkalizing agents, such as bicarbonate, are used by athletes to improve performance and delay fatigue.", "SUPLEMENTOS PROTEICOS:Protein supplements are used by athletes to enhance muscle growth and recovery.", "BETA-HIDROXI-BETA-METILBUTIRATO:Beta-hydroxy-beta-methylbutyrate (HMB) is a supplement used by athletes to promote muscle growth and recovery.", "ÁCIDO LINOLÉICO CONJUGADO:El ácido linoleico conjugado (CLA) es un compuesto utilizado para la optimización del peso y la composición corporal.", "CARTÍLAGO DE TIBURÓN:El cartílago de tiburón se utiliza para aumentar la resistencia a las lesiones y para la recuperación de lesiones asociadas con el ejercicio.", "MUCOPOLISACÁRIDOS:Los mucopolisacáridos son compuestos utilizados para la prevención y recuperación de lesiones en el ámbito deportivo."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}